DTEND:20260914T113343Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 13:58:32 and reappears at 15:00:55 +0330\, 
 seen from Isfahan\, IR.\nThe Moon is 40° up in the S · daylight\, Sun +4
 9°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view 
 at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=32.6525&
 lon=51.6746
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=32.6525&lon=51.6746
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
